<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>A Little Surprise 💗</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; padding: 24px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe0ec,#f3e4ff);
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #743553;
  text-align: center;
}
.card {
  background: #ffffffdd; padding: 30px 22px;
  border-radius: 25px; max-width: 390px; width: 100%;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #b96d9833;
}
h1 { color: #d94f89; }
p { line-height: 1.7; }
button {
  border: 0; border-radius: 30px; padding: 13px 20px;
  margin: 7px; background: #ed78a8; color: white;
  font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;
}
button:hover { background: #d94f89; }
.hidden { display: none; }
.heart { font-size: 42px; animation: beat 1s infinite; }
@keyframes beat {
  50% { transform: scale(1.15); }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <section id="page1">
    <div class="heart">💌</div>
    <h1>Hiii, kamu!</h1>
    <p>Ada sesuatu buat kamu nih...</p>
    <button onclick="showPage(2)">Pencet aku ✨</button>
  </section>

  <section id="page2" class="hidden">
    <h1>Mini Quiz 💗</h1>
    <p id="question">Pertanyaan 1: siapa yang bikin website ini?</p>
    <button onclick="answer(true)">Kamu dong?</button>
    <button onclick="answer(false)">Orang lain?</button>
    <p id="feedback"></p>
    <button id="next" class="hidden"
      onclick="showPage(3)">Lanjut ➜</button>
  </section>

  <section id="page3" class="hidden">
    <div class="heart">🎁</div>
    <h1>Surprise!</h1>
    <p>Hai, kamu yang spesial buat aku.</p>
    <p>Aku bikin halaman kecil ini khusus buat kamu.
    Mungkin sederhana, tapi aku berharap ini bisa
    bikin kamu senyum hari ini 💗</p>
    <button onclick="showPage(4)">Ada satu lagi...</button>
  </section>

  <section id="page4" class="hidden">
    <div class="heart">💖</div>
    <h1>Pesan buat kamu</h1>
    <p>Makasih ya udah jadi bagian dari hari-hariku.
    Semoga kita selalu bisa saling menghargai,
    saling mendukung, dan bikin banyak kenangan baik.</p>
    <p>— dari seseorang yang bikin website ini ♡</p>
    <button onclick="showPage(1)">Ulangi dari awal ↻</button>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
function showPage(n) {
  document.querySelectorAll("section").forEach(s =>
    s.classList.add("hidden")
  );
  document.getElementById("page" + n).classList.remove("hidden");
}
function answer(correct) {
  document.getElementById("feedback").textContent = correct
    ? "YAP BENER BANGET 😭💗"
    : "Yahh, coba pikir lagi wkwk 😭";
  document.getElementById("next").classList.remove("hidden");
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
# Build and Release Folders
bin-debug/
bin-release/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]in/

# Other files and folders
.settings/

# Executables
*.swf
*.air
*.ipa
*.apk

# Project files, i.e. `.project`, `.actionScriptProperties` and `.flexProperties`
# should NOT be excluded as they contain compiler settings and other important
# information for Eclipse / Flash Builder.
